    "Details": "Configuration A features Large Pulse Lasers in both arms and heavy HAG/30 ballistic weapons in both torsos. Ammo is spread across torso and legs for sustained fire. This setup includes a Supercharger and three Jump Jets in the center torso and both legs for enhanced mobility. Cooling is managed by 17 double heat sinks, providing excellent heat dissipation during combat.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.19</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
